%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Pod
    participant S3 as Object Storage
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant RD as Redis / BullMQ
    participant W as Worker Pod
    participant EMB as Embedding Server

    rect rgb(30, 41, 59)
    Note over C,A: Synchronous — ends at 202
    C->>A: POST /api/v1/sessions<br/>Bearer JWT
    A->>A: jwtVerify + rate limit + set RLS context
    A->>PG: Idempotency check<br/>(org, developer, client_id)
    alt session exists
        PG-->>A: existing record
        A-->>C: 202 + trackingUrl (no-op)
    end
    A->>A: sessionId = uuidv5(org:dev:clientId)
    A->>S3: PUT raw payload<br/>IfNoneMatch='*', SHA-256
    A->>PG: BEGIN → INSERT session + INSERT outbox → COMMIT
    A-->>C: 202 Accepted + trackingUrl
    end

    rect rgb(45, 27, 105)
    Note over W,PG: Asynchronous — durable via outbox
    loop every 1 second
        W->>PG: Claim outbox batch<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        W->>RD: Publish with deterministic jobId
        W->>PG: Mark published
    end

    RD->>W: session.process job
    W->>S3: GET raw payload
    W->>W: Parse → Segment → Governance gate
    W->>EMB: embedBatch (1536d)
    W->>PG: BEGIN → INSERT chunks + actions + outbox → COMMIT

    par Per-action enrichment (5 parallel)
        W->>PG: index → search_index_entries
        W->>PG: facts → memory_facts
        W->>PG: knowledge → knowledge_records
        W->>PG: deduplicate → chunk_clusters
        W->>PG: graph → graph_nodes/edges
    end

    W->>PG: Lock chunk → mark terminal → reconcile projection
    end

    rect rgb(30, 41, 59)
    Note over C,A: Client polls for completion
    C->>A: GET /api/v1/sessions/:id/status
    A-->>C: searchableStatus + enrichmentStatus
    end
